WEBVTT

00:01.565 --> 00:02.902
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.926 --> 00:04.261
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.285 --> 00:07.501
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.525 --> 00:13.085
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.085 --> 01:31.045
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.205 --> 01:34.445
=Episode 31=

01:35.695 --> 01:37.215
His Highness is going up the mountain.

01:37.270 --> 01:38.325
Please make way.

01:46.645 --> 01:47.965
Won't you fight?

01:49.120 --> 01:50.564
The kid wishes to enjoy the view

01:50.695 --> 01:51.871
and it has nothing to do with me.

01:51.895 --> 01:53.085
Why would I help him?

01:54.620 --> 01:55.582
Your Highness,

01:55.606 --> 01:56.644
pardon me.

01:57.070 --> 01:58.070
Stop!

01:59.745 --> 02:00.825
Let him go up the mountain.

02:01.920 --> 02:03.971
You're in no position to give orders.

02:03.995 --> 02:05.124
It's Old Ancestor's order

02:05.445 --> 02:07.085
that Xu Fengnian goes up Guniujiang.

02:07.420 --> 02:08.844
It's Old Ancestor's order?

02:08.945 --> 02:10.795
How would I dare to lie to you?

02:19.920 --> 02:20.920
Get out of the way.

02:22.070 --> 02:23.244
I'll lead the way.

02:44.295 --> 02:45.295
Go.

02:50.470 --> 02:53.170
(Mount Hui Snowfield Guniujiang)

02:59.370 --> 03:01.364
Here I am at last.

03:11.120 --> 03:12.845
I, Xuanyuan Jingcheng,

03:13.920 --> 03:16.345
ask to see you, Old Ancestor.

03:30.195 --> 03:32.795
(Xuanyuan Dapan,
Old Ancestor of the Xuanyuan Family)

03:39.020 --> 03:41.471
Xuanyuan Dapan doesn't know
that I'm going up the mountain, right?

03:41.495 --> 03:42.644
You made it up?

03:43.195 --> 03:44.770
If he's dead,

03:45.070 --> 03:46.395
no one will know it.

03:47.270 --> 03:48.644
What if he lives?

03:49.345 --> 03:50.764
Then everything's over.

03:51.320 --> 03:52.970
Who would care about a lie by then?

03:53.420 --> 03:54.321
Old man.

03:54.345 --> 03:54.982
Hey.

03:55.006 --> 03:56.846
Do you think
she's got a better figure than me?

03:57.570 --> 03:58.570
She was raised well.

03:58.970 --> 03:59.970
She's better than you.

04:00.695 --> 04:02.165
So what?

04:03.145 --> 04:04.684
I'm still growing.

04:05.320 --> 04:06.045
It's fine.

04:06.145 --> 04:07.585
Xu Fengnian doesn't care about that.

04:08.570 --> 04:10.204
I don't care how he feels.

04:13.570 --> 04:15.095
It's been many years.

04:15.245 --> 04:17.324
I underestimated you.

04:18.220 --> 04:20.045
You came because of your daughter?

04:21.770 --> 04:24.324
The hundred-year prestige
of the Xuanyuan Family

04:25.620 --> 04:28.045
has been maintained by you.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.595
I, on behalf
of the entire Xuanyuan Family,

04:30.895 --> 04:32.395
thank you.

04:34.745 --> 04:36.124
Your daughter

04:36.195 --> 04:37.845
is the thank-you gift.

04:44.545 --> 04:46.605
But it's a wrong way.

04:46.970 --> 04:48.245
So what if it's wrong?

04:48.595 --> 04:51.165
Here I challenge you.

04:53.295 --> 04:54.525
Jingcheng,

04:54.570 --> 04:58.004
have you read the resonance
of the sky and the earth yet?

04:58.270 --> 04:59.395
Do you know

04:59.520 --> 05:00.965
which stage

05:01.270 --> 05:03.804
is the Celestial Realm?

05:08.070 --> 05:09.820
Whether it's Celestial Realm or not,

05:11.095 --> 05:12.795
you'll see after the fight.

05:13.095 --> 05:14.924
I'd like to see

05:15.195 --> 05:18.124
if you can withstand
over a hundred moves.

05:44.370 --> 05:45.370
What's happening?

05:45.520 --> 05:47.085
Who is fighting with Old Ancestor?

05:50.245 --> 05:51.245
It has begun.

05:51.445 --> 05:52.804
Who do you think will win?

05:53.920 --> 05:55.324
I, of course, wish my father wins.

05:56.395 --> 05:58.475
But Xuanyuan Dapan
is a Celestial Realm-stage master.

05:58.645 --> 06:00.444
He excels in all kinds of martial arts.

06:01.045 --> 06:02.165
To defeat him

06:02.295 --> 06:03.364
won't be easy.

06:03.695 --> 06:05.320
I'd like

06:05.795 --> 06:07.364
to shake Mount Kunlun alone.

06:12.345 --> 06:14.741
Is Celestial Realm really
capable of changing the weather?

06:14.765 --> 06:16.845
It just happens
that the thunder is rumbling.

06:17.095 --> 06:18.645
If he could alter the weather,

06:18.695 --> 06:20.745
then there would be no draught or flood.

06:22.270 --> 06:23.261
I don't understand it.

06:23.285 --> 06:24.924
It is what you say it is.

06:26.845 --> 06:28.145
Master Jingxuan is dead.

06:28.525 --> 06:30.046
Xuanyuan Jingcheng killed him.

06:30.070 --> 06:31.405
Nonsense.

06:31.645 --> 06:32.965
Where is the nerd?

06:33.370 --> 06:35.220
He's on the snowfield.

06:37.445 --> 06:38.765
Impossible.

06:41.420 --> 06:42.246
Elder Li.

06:42.270 --> 06:42.861
Hmm?

06:42.885 --> 06:44.460
How good is Xuanyuan Dapan?

06:44.484 --> 06:45.900
He lost to me when we had a sword match.

06:45.924 --> 06:47.520
After that? I don't know.

06:48.695 --> 06:50.645
It looks he's better than before.

06:52.020 --> 06:53.020
What about her dad?

06:54.070 --> 06:54.972
Her dad?

06:54.996 --> 06:57.670
From what I'm seeing here,
he hasn't reached Celestial Realm yet.

07:02.745 --> 07:04.245
He'll lose for certain, right?

07:04.745 --> 07:07.121
The realm stage isn't
the only determinant.

07:07.145 --> 07:09.795
Both Xuanyuan Dapan and
Wang Xianzhi are at Celestial Realm,

07:10.045 --> 07:11.765
but Wang can defeat him singlehanded.

07:11.795 --> 07:12.795
What about you?

07:14.170 --> 07:15.495
The same. Singlehanded.

07:54.345 --> 07:55.345
This

07:55.920 --> 07:58.085
is the best you can do, right?

08:07.220 --> 08:08.244
The second one.

08:15.220 --> 08:16.395
The third one.

08:39.645 --> 08:41.495
Move air against the sea.

08:41.670 --> 08:44.995
No matter who wins the match,

08:45.270 --> 08:48.245
you'll be a dead man for sure.

08:48.495 --> 08:49.995
Please come with me,

08:50.495 --> 08:52.365
Old Ancestor.

08:52.970 --> 08:54.324
You?

08:54.570 --> 08:58.165
And your contrived Celestial Realm?

09:21.870 --> 09:23.230
How come there are three tornados?

09:23.395 --> 09:24.746
There will soon be a result.

09:24.770 --> 09:26.964
Live or die, it'll be decided soon.

09:52.445 --> 09:53.724
It is him.

10:00.405 --> 10:01.684
He's going to win?

10:36.070 --> 10:37.520
Be careful, Old Ancestor.

10:44.045 --> 10:45.045
He did it!

11:00.845 --> 11:03.405
This one attack of yours cost your life,

11:03.445 --> 11:05.724
but you still failed to hurt me.

11:23.695 --> 11:25.005
You came, too.

11:25.145 --> 11:26.285
Good.

11:26.920 --> 11:28.564
After I end his life,

11:28.795 --> 11:30.604
I'll fight you, God of Sword.

11:34.084 --> 11:36.485
Since I couldn't kill you
with the power of Celestial Realm,

11:36.770 --> 11:37.885
I'll have to

11:38.245 --> 11:39.765
take another step up.

11:41.445 --> 11:44.289
The next stage of Celestial Realm

11:44.545 --> 11:46.645
is Immortal-on-Earth.

11:46.895 --> 11:49.700
Even Wang Xianzhi
hasn't achieved it yet.

11:49.724 --> 11:52.170
How can you make it?

12:03.645 --> 12:04.684
Old Ancestor,

12:05.745 --> 12:08.084
have you heard of epiphyllum?

12:11.270 --> 12:13.125
It decays as it blooms.

12:14.570 --> 12:16.670
Its magnificence lasts only an instant.

12:40.145 --> 12:41.204
This is

12:42.120 --> 12:44.420
Immortal-on-Earth Realm.

12:44.444 --> 12:45.695
Immortal-on-Earth?

12:45.845 --> 12:47.420
Is it so easily achieved?

12:48.020 --> 12:50.381
He's burning his own
blood and vital energy

12:50.405 --> 12:51.521
to ignite his heart flame

12:51.545 --> 12:52.940
and mount the apex.

12:52.964 --> 12:54.324
But like he said,

12:54.595 --> 12:55.844
it decays and it blooms.

12:55.895 --> 12:57.095
This is

12:57.320 --> 12:59.005
the end of his life.

13:02.920 --> 13:04.570
It's impossible.

13:04.995 --> 13:07.125
Even if you sacrifice your life,

13:07.795 --> 13:08.701
it's impossible

13:08.725 --> 13:11.345
for you to reach
Immortal-on-Earth Realm.

13:11.770 --> 13:13.650
Doing good is
as difficult as mountain-climbing.

13:13.920 --> 13:15.924
Still, Mount Kunlun is reachable.

13:16.295 --> 13:18.461
You should really read carefully

13:18.485 --> 13:20.964
the books that you deem useless.

13:21.145 --> 13:24.420
If you don't comprehend
the law of the universe,

13:25.720 --> 13:26.995
you'll never

13:27.920 --> 13:30.005
achieve this stage in this life.

13:30.670 --> 13:33.195
You aren't qualified to lecture me.

13:44.020 --> 13:46.964
Will you leave
any last words to Mount Hui?

13:52.195 --> 13:55.564
Even if you now are
an immortal on Earth,

13:55.845 --> 13:57.395
how much longer can you live?

13:57.545 --> 13:59.245
If I dodge the best I can,

13:59.445 --> 14:01.324
you won't be able to kill me.

14:01.545 --> 14:02.621
In the end,

14:02.645 --> 14:04.895
it'll be me who watches you

14:05.195 --> 14:07.045
die in regret.

14:08.120 --> 14:09.501
He'll just dodge?

14:09.525 --> 14:10.700
That's cheeky of him.

14:10.724 --> 14:12.005
That's called being realistic.

14:12.345 --> 14:13.525
What would you do?

14:13.695 --> 14:15.924
A sword-wielder never backs off.

14:29.370 --> 14:30.370
Seriously?

14:30.445 --> 14:32.096
He still makes use of the sky.

14:32.120 --> 14:33.580
If he was an immortal on Earth,

14:33.604 --> 14:34.900
he would be able to kill him
with his own power.

14:34.924 --> 14:36.245
He's amazing enough.

14:36.645 --> 14:38.995
How much longer do you get to live?

14:43.670 --> 14:44.670
Dad.

14:58.420 --> 14:59.580
Wait, wait, wait.

14:59.604 --> 15:01.021
I can turn the authority
over to Qingfeng.

15:01.045 --> 15:02.022
I swear

15:02.046 --> 15:03.525
that I'll never touch her.

15:10.495 --> 15:11.525
Please

15:12.645 --> 15:14.844
ascend to the heavens, Old Ancestor.

16:48.795 --> 16:50.120
Mount Hui

16:52.720 --> 16:54.604
will be yours.

16:57.520 --> 16:58.520
Dad.

17:02.020 --> 17:03.020
Dad.

17:05.920 --> 17:06.920
Dad.

18:01.220 --> 18:02.765
Old Ancestor has gone.

18:03.870 --> 18:06.205
The family needs a leader.

18:06.695 --> 18:08.100
The heavy burden

18:08.124 --> 18:09.495
shall fall onto me.

18:09.645 --> 18:10.645
Disciples.

18:10.845 --> 18:12.901
Seize the daughter of the rebel.

18:12.925 --> 18:13.925
Wait.

18:28.770 --> 18:30.295
I, Xu Fengnian of North Liang,

18:30.695 --> 18:32.395
would like to lead Xuanyuan

18:32.670 --> 18:34.404
following God's will.

19:13.345 --> 19:14.045
Carry him away.

19:14.195 --> 19:15.195
- Yes.
- Yes.

19:21.345 --> 19:22.345
Ma'am.

19:22.695 --> 19:24.695
Xuanyuan Dapan is dead.

19:36.645 --> 19:37.645
What about him?

19:38.670 --> 19:39.920
How did he end up?

19:40.745 --> 19:42.124
Master Jingcheng

19:42.995 --> 19:45.395
fought the old villain with his life,

19:45.745 --> 19:47.070
and eventually perished.

19:57.045 --> 19:58.604
You came to seek refugee?

20:01.170 --> 20:02.470
Master Jingcheng said,

20:03.320 --> 20:04.604
if he dies in the battle,

20:05.970 --> 20:09.245
I'm to hand the sachet to you.

20:39.685 --> 20:40.725
Your Highness,

20:41.370 --> 20:42.564
this is Mount Hui,

20:42.870 --> 20:44.164
not North Liang.

20:44.770 --> 20:47.300
Xuanyuan Jingcheng
rebelled against the ancestor,

20:47.324 --> 20:48.495
which is a heavy sin.

20:48.845 --> 20:51.420
How can his daughter command Mount Hui?

20:52.020 --> 20:53.844
Even if we put this aside,

20:53.970 --> 20:55.945
all family affairs

20:56.045 --> 20:59.045
were handled by me and Jingxuan.

20:59.295 --> 21:00.604
There's too much to attend to.

21:00.945 --> 21:03.164
How does she cope?

21:08.645 --> 21:11.404
Even if she is given authority,

21:12.084 --> 21:14.725
how many of us will obey?

21:16.370 --> 21:17.965
You're in high status, Your Highness.

21:18.745 --> 21:22.564
I'm sure you'll handle everything well.

21:22.970 --> 21:27.045
But how long will you stay in Mount Hui?

21:27.870 --> 21:29.725
He has a point.

21:31.770 --> 21:33.965
If I become the householder,

21:34.145 --> 21:37.245
I'd like to ally with North Liang.

21:38.895 --> 21:40.564
As for my niece,

21:41.745 --> 21:43.164
you can have her.

21:44.795 --> 21:47.725
You've got shameless uncles.

22:06.545 --> 22:08.470
Uncle Jingyi has an unruly personality.

22:09.545 --> 22:11.205
Now that Xuanyuan Dapan,

22:11.695 --> 22:13.564
my dad and Uncle Jingxuan are all dead,

22:14.170 --> 22:16.045
no one can hold
his ambition in check now.

22:18.095 --> 22:19.965
North Liang is far away
from Mount Hui.

22:20.670 --> 22:22.746
I bet he'll break loose of North Liang.

22:22.770 --> 22:25.804
He may even stab you in the back.

22:26.670 --> 22:27.925
Do you dare

22:29.245 --> 22:30.485
to ally with someone like this?

22:32.495 --> 22:34.604
How are you better than me?

22:39.445 --> 22:40.765
He's asking you a question.

22:42.820 --> 22:43.772
Yes.

22:43.796 --> 22:45.485
It's a tricky question.

22:45.620 --> 22:46.620
Why?

22:46.970 --> 22:49.595
If the girl says
she's loyal to North Liang,

22:49.720 --> 22:51.124
the Xuanyuan Family won't be happy.

22:51.245 --> 22:52.884
If she says she's loyal to the family,

22:53.145 --> 22:54.820
then Xu Fengnian has
no reason to help her.

22:54.844 --> 22:56.695
It'll be a wrong answer
either way, right?

23:00.745 --> 23:02.385
Princess, you should think about it, too.

23:02.520 --> 23:03.765
When the time comes,

23:03.795 --> 23:05.564
what would you choose

23:05.795 --> 23:07.275
between your homeland
and Xu Fengnian?

23:08.970 --> 23:10.221
Chess Master?

23:10.245 --> 23:12.164
A voice through air.
No one else can hear it.

23:17.495 --> 23:18.925
You heard it, too?

23:19.445 --> 23:21.005
It took him so much effort to find you,

23:21.095 --> 23:22.621
would he leave you be?

23:22.645 --> 23:24.084
He's been with us along the way.

23:36.495 --> 23:38.245
I swear

23:38.645 --> 23:40.100
that if I'm in charge of Xuanyuan,

23:40.124 --> 23:41.604
I shall do all I can

23:42.145 --> 23:43.501
to reinvigorate our family,

23:43.525 --> 23:45.485
making sure the Xuanyuan Family
never falls again.

23:54.320 --> 23:56.270
Everybody can brag.

23:56.804 --> 23:58.164
What actions will you take?

23:58.595 --> 24:00.084
Once I'm the householder,

24:00.220 --> 24:03.005
Wending Pavilion
will be open to the entire family.

24:03.620 --> 24:04.780
Even a retainer

24:04.804 --> 24:06.570
gets to study inside of it.

24:07.070 --> 24:08.646
If Qingfeng's in charge...

24:08.670 --> 24:09.247
Perfect.

24:09.271 --> 24:10.421
- We can enter Wending Pavilion, too.
- Yeah, that'd be great.

24:10.445 --> 24:12.085
- Right.
- We can study martial arts, too.

24:13.545 --> 24:15.485
Reinvigorate the family?

24:18.285 --> 24:23.045
I'm afraid the family
would serve under certain people.

24:23.945 --> 24:25.860
Now that Xuanyuan Dapan is dead,

24:25.884 --> 24:27.525
Mount Hui is out on a limb.

24:27.745 --> 24:29.164
The alliance with North Liang

24:29.370 --> 24:31.330
will serve as the shelter
for the Xuanyuan Family.

24:32.120 --> 24:33.644
But here I take a vow

24:34.195 --> 24:36.884
that the Xuanyuan Family
will never take orders from others.

24:37.245 --> 24:39.846
- Before the next Celestial Realm rises,
- It'd be perfect. Yeah.

24:39.870 --> 24:40.870
The Xuanyuan Family

24:40.945 --> 24:43.120
will cooperate with North Liang
the best we can.

24:44.445 --> 24:46.765
What if there's a new Celestial Realm?

24:47.345 --> 24:49.485
If there's one,
we'll renegotiate the terms.

24:49.844 --> 24:50.844
It's honest of you.

24:54.220 --> 24:55.925
You two can't decide the master

24:56.395 --> 24:58.844
of the Xuanyuan Family by talking.

24:59.295 --> 25:00.525
Eventually,

25:01.070 --> 25:04.205
it's decided by the will
of our clansmen.

25:04.520 --> 25:05.520
Everybody,

25:06.205 --> 25:07.395
if our clan

25:07.670 --> 25:10.445
is under the control
of such a young girl,

25:10.804 --> 25:12.965
won't we be laughed at?

25:13.795 --> 25:15.725
Ask yourselves.

25:16.485 --> 25:18.995
Who's better suited to be the master?

25:20.920 --> 25:22.364
Isn't it obvious?

25:24.745 --> 25:28.205
Hierarchy is fundamental to a clan.

25:28.495 --> 25:29.920
Good point.

25:32.395 --> 25:34.485
Hierarchy.

25:35.970 --> 25:37.164
Qingfeng,

25:37.395 --> 25:38.804
listen.

25:39.595 --> 25:42.620
This is the will of our clansmen!

25:48.295 --> 25:49.920
He's killed?

25:54.545 --> 25:56.545
I can't believe he's killed.

26:14.270 --> 26:16.485
Speaking of hierarchy,

26:17.220 --> 26:19.485
Master Jingcheng
is the eldest lineal son

26:20.520 --> 26:22.324
and Miss Qingfeng should be the master

26:22.620 --> 26:25.844
with the right reason.

26:26.070 --> 26:28.045
Xuanyuan Jingyi died.

26:28.445 --> 26:31.124
My Lady, take over the Xuanyuan Family.

26:31.945 --> 26:35.225
- My Lady, take over the Xuanyuan Family.
- My Lady, take over the Xuanyuan Family.

26:35.370 --> 26:38.650
- My Lady, take over the Xuanyuan Family.
- My Lady, take over the Xuanyuan Family.

26:51.870 --> 26:52.870
I didn't give that order.

26:54.545 --> 26:55.770
Who else did that, then?

26:58.895 --> 27:00.725
Your father is really something.

27:32.970 --> 27:33.995
The rain has stopped.

27:43.595 --> 27:45.020
The situation has changed.

27:47.495 --> 27:49.070
Excuse me?

27:51.145 --> 27:52.364
Didn't you hear me?

27:55.295 --> 27:58.445
Xuanyuan Jingcheng and Xuanyuan Dapan
died together.

27:59.570 --> 28:01.145
Xuanyuan Qingfeng

28:01.845 --> 28:03.670
will take over the Xuanyuan Family.

28:05.070 --> 28:06.845
What do you think she'll do to you?

28:09.595 --> 28:10.595
That's impossible.

28:12.570 --> 28:14.730
I don't care if you believe that.

28:15.870 --> 28:18.124
But you don't have too much time

28:19.520 --> 28:20.604
to make a decision.

28:48.020 --> 28:49.580
Hold a decent funeral for Uncle Jingyi.

28:50.270 --> 28:51.525
We will, My Lady.

28:53.245 --> 28:54.445
Take down Yuan Tingshan.

28:55.545 --> 28:56.545
Yes.

29:06.145 --> 29:07.145
Search for him!

29:07.420 --> 29:08.420
- Yes.
- Yes.

29:24.270 --> 29:25.270
Do you believe it now?

29:27.020 --> 29:28.500
Why did you come and inform me of it?

29:29.395 --> 29:30.395
I want to help you.

29:33.045 --> 29:34.245
Why?

29:43.370 --> 29:44.595
Xu Fengnian

29:45.420 --> 29:46.341
has ruined your chance.

29:46.365 --> 29:47.695
Do you hate him?

29:52.120 --> 29:53.124
Shall we

29:55.570 --> 29:56.870
join hands to kill him?

30:01.995 --> 30:03.485
I'm not a fool.

30:03.895 --> 30:04.895
Come on.

30:05.945 --> 30:07.604
If you want supreme martial arts,

30:08.420 --> 30:09.525
I can give you the books.

30:11.895 --> 30:13.445
If you want a bright future,

30:16.520 --> 30:18.364
I can give it to you, too.

30:23.095 --> 30:24.095
He's gone?

30:24.945 --> 30:25.945
Go search for him!

30:29.045 --> 30:30.644
You have no way out, anyway.

30:32.570 --> 30:33.685
Leave with me.

30:34.820 --> 30:35.820
I have...

30:37.595 --> 30:38.595
a surprise

30:40.095 --> 30:41.095
for you.

30:44.670 --> 30:45.745
You may rise.

30:50.995 --> 30:52.245
I'll keep my promise.

30:52.945 --> 30:53.945
From this day on,

30:54.145 --> 30:55.820
all clansmen of the Xuanyuan Family
have access to Wending Pavilion

30:55.844 --> 30:56.844
to learn martial arts.

30:57.420 --> 30:59.765
Retainers making contributions
are allowed in, too.

30:59.995 --> 31:00.697
Great.

31:00.721 --> 31:01.595
This is great.

31:01.745 --> 31:03.745
- We can enter Wending Pavilion.
- Yeah.

31:08.020 --> 31:10.644
Don't you fear that a genius will appear

31:11.220 --> 31:12.525
and take your place?

31:13.320 --> 31:15.364
It's a special solution
for this special period.

31:15.595 --> 31:16.915
Now that I've made this decision,

31:17.170 --> 31:18.810
I'm brave enough
to face any consequences.

31:20.670 --> 31:22.364
You indeed behave like a master.

31:26.170 --> 31:27.245
Who are you, sir?

31:28.420 --> 31:29.795
My name isn't worth mentioning.

31:29.895 --> 31:31.860
I made a mistake
and got my family involved.

31:31.884 --> 31:33.884
Jingcheng saved my family.

31:34.295 --> 31:36.525
I must pay him back for that.

31:46.070 --> 31:47.285
My father left this to me?

31:47.520 --> 31:48.520
Yes.

32:01.820 --> 32:02.820
One for me, too?

32:04.245 --> 32:05.765
Your Highness, according to Jingcheng,

32:05.920 --> 32:07.245
after Xuanyuan Dapan died,

32:07.345 --> 32:09.070
if you helped Miss Qingfeng,

32:09.370 --> 32:11.804
I would give this to you.

32:12.645 --> 32:14.245
It's foresighted of him.

32:15.645 --> 32:16.645
Don't you open it?

32:20.270 --> 32:21.830
Your Highness, you haven't replied yet.

32:21.945 --> 32:23.124
What do you want from us?

32:26.845 --> 32:27.970
Many people are around.

32:28.195 --> 32:29.355
Shall we have a private talk?

32:45.870 --> 32:47.570
Girl, you're enjoying the flowers?

32:51.345 --> 32:52.195
It's sweet.

32:52.345 --> 32:53.345
What?

32:53.820 --> 32:55.701
There's honey in the flower.

32:55.725 --> 32:57.220
So, it tastes sweet.

32:58.820 --> 33:00.100
When I was gluttonous at a young age,

33:00.124 --> 33:01.245
I often ate the petals.

33:01.420 --> 33:02.746
Other girls

33:02.770 --> 33:04.701
enjoy and love flowers.

33:04.725 --> 33:05.725
But you eat them.

33:05.995 --> 33:08.045
I live a hard life,
so I love sweet things.

33:13.120 --> 33:14.145
It's indeed sweet.

33:35.870 --> 33:37.285
My father loved reading.

33:38.020 --> 33:39.525
This is where he usually sat.

33:39.995 --> 33:41.445
When he was tired,

33:42.295 --> 33:44.124
he liked to look out of the window.

33:45.470 --> 33:46.804
Nothing special, I think.

33:47.820 --> 33:48.820
Yeah.

33:50.320 --> 33:52.820
The window isn't near the river.

33:53.145 --> 33:54.625
There's no scenery out there, either.

33:55.420 --> 33:57.485
I don't know
what he was looking at every day.

33:59.745 --> 34:01.005
I never understood

34:01.670 --> 34:03.005
what he was thinking of.

34:05.595 --> 34:06.795
Fathers

34:07.545 --> 34:08.925
always behave like that.

34:10.520 --> 34:11.946
They arrange everything,

34:11.970 --> 34:13.090
take all the responsibility,

34:14.370 --> 34:15.890
and never want to tell their children.

34:19.720 --> 34:21.145
You're right, I guess.

34:43.370 --> 34:44.370
What's the letter about?

34:44.495 --> 34:46.381
Characters, preferences, and experiences

34:46.405 --> 34:47.605
of our clansmen and retainers.

34:47.995 --> 34:49.670
He kept this to control them, I suppose.

34:55.320 --> 34:56.604
I think it took him a long time.

35:03.995 --> 35:06.221
If Xu Fengnian is too greedy,

35:06.245 --> 35:07.745
don't fight against him.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.325
Take shelter

35:09.795 --> 35:10.925
from Mount Longhu.

35:19.995 --> 35:21.470
On Tomb Sweeping Days,

35:22.320 --> 35:24.120
if your mother doesn't want
to go to my tomb,

35:24.645 --> 35:25.845
don't force her.

35:26.770 --> 35:28.520
When I can't spend my life with her,

35:29.220 --> 35:31.485
it's also my luck

35:32.320 --> 35:33.795
to set her free.

35:34.720 --> 35:36.020
Since you were born,

35:36.670 --> 35:38.445
I've buried jars of wine

35:38.745 --> 35:40.420
under the osmanthus tree.

35:41.495 --> 35:42.724
One jar for each year.

35:43.545 --> 35:46.644
There have been 23 jars so far.

35:48.195 --> 35:49.644
Privately, I call them

35:50.470 --> 35:51.845
Daughter's Wine.

35:53.070 --> 35:54.070
What do you think?

35:56.245 --> 35:57.684
Don't blame me for nagging.

35:58.745 --> 35:59.805
In the past,

36:00.520 --> 36:02.341
I only said a few words to you

36:02.365 --> 36:03.805
every year.

36:05.070 --> 36:07.245
I've got a lot to tell you,

36:08.545 --> 36:10.485
but I don't know
how to start the conversation.

36:14.145 --> 36:15.145
Qingfeng,

36:16.820 --> 36:18.495
my biggest regret

36:19.595 --> 36:21.925
is that I can't watch you get married.

36:24.095 --> 36:25.325
If you get married,

36:26.245 --> 36:28.204
name your son Fuyao

36:29.145 --> 36:31.405
and name your daughter Yasong.

36:32.270 --> 36:33.270
All right?

36:35.045 --> 36:36.885
No matter whether
they want to learn literature

36:36.920 --> 36:38.759
or martial arts, let them be.

36:39.195 --> 36:40.485
Life is short.

36:41.145 --> 36:42.970
Living a simple life

36:43.520 --> 36:44.724
will be a great thing.

36:46.495 --> 36:48.204
It's better than my life.

36:49.295 --> 36:51.120
I never got what I wanted

36:51.895 --> 36:53.445
and I made your mother hate me.

36:54.745 --> 36:56.005
In case you get annoyed,

36:57.070 --> 36:58.470
I'll say no more.

36:59.570 --> 37:00.570
Wish you

37:02.295 --> 37:03.870
a good life

37:05.525 --> 37:07.070
and a healthy body.

37:15.995 --> 37:17.325
I understand now.

37:31.945 --> 37:33.501
Seen through the window,

37:33.525 --> 37:34.644
there's no scenery.

37:36.495 --> 37:38.220
But you look farther on,

37:39.995 --> 37:41.875
you'll see the house
where my mother and I live.

37:52.095 --> 37:54.015
What message did he leave
for you, Your Highness?

38:16.120 --> 38:17.645
Well, your father...

38:21.395 --> 38:22.695
Mount Hui has declined.

38:23.120 --> 38:26.070
Your Highness, if you want our clan,

38:26.870 --> 38:29.295
please spare my daughter's life.

38:31.070 --> 38:34.365
There're treasures and secret books
in Xuanyuan Dapan's mansion.

38:35.120 --> 38:36.885
They're all yours.

38:38.470 --> 38:40.764
Xuanyuan Dapan lives
on Snowfield Guniujiang.

38:41.270 --> 38:42.710
You can take away whatever you want.

38:43.695 --> 38:45.195
I don't want the treasures

38:45.570 --> 38:47.090
or secret martial arts of your family.

38:51.170 --> 38:52.570
So, you want me?

38:54.145 --> 38:55.421
Qingniao, who's out of the room,

38:55.445 --> 38:56.965
is as beautiful as you.

38:57.295 --> 38:58.775
She has better martial arts than you.

38:59.244 --> 39:00.244
She isn't very talkative.

39:00.320 --> 39:02.084
But she's sensible and witty.

39:02.270 --> 39:03.510
She's a talented and wise girl.

39:03.570 --> 39:04.541
In my mansion,
I've got six or seven maids

39:04.565 --> 39:06.005
just like her.

39:06.095 --> 39:07.284
Why do I want you?

39:07.370 --> 39:08.525
Your Highness,

39:09.095 --> 39:10.965
what exactly do you want from my family?

39:15.770 --> 39:16.770
Wait a minute.

39:26.820 --> 39:27.965
So sweet.

39:29.495 --> 39:30.495
Have some more, then.

39:31.795 --> 39:32.795
Sweet.

39:33.520 --> 39:34.520
Qingniao.

39:34.770 --> 39:35.770
Would you like some?

39:37.295 --> 39:38.495
It's very good.

39:42.695 --> 39:43.695
Sweet.

39:45.770 --> 39:46.495
What?

39:46.620 --> 39:47.620
Some business.

39:51.295 --> 39:52.764
You're gathering honey?

39:53.670 --> 39:54.920
It's very sweet.

39:55.645 --> 39:56.284
Senior,

39:56.370 --> 39:58.120
you're the God of Sword, after all.

39:58.724 --> 40:00.145
Don't put everything in your mouth.

40:00.395 --> 40:01.395
Would you like some?

40:05.270 --> 40:06.270
Would you like some?

40:07.645 --> 40:09.244
Don't stand on ceremony. Here.

40:21.220 --> 40:22.220
She's my maid.

40:23.645 --> 40:24.645
To be honest,

40:24.945 --> 40:26.185
she's the princess of West Chu.

40:26.720 --> 40:27.720
Don't talk nonsense.

40:29.545 --> 40:30.821
When we want a favor from her,

40:30.845 --> 40:31.965
we can't hide your identity.

40:32.670 --> 40:33.870
Princess of West Chu?

40:34.370 --> 40:35.370
How shall I help her?

40:36.170 --> 40:37.101
In a couple of days,

40:37.125 --> 40:38.295
she's going back to West Shu.

40:38.745 --> 40:39.746
It's a long trip.

40:39.770 --> 40:41.245
The fastest and safest way

40:41.470 --> 40:42.470
is to travel by water.

40:47.395 --> 40:48.670
Escorting her back home

40:49.120 --> 40:50.645
is the first favor I want from you.

40:51.795 --> 40:53.120
I can travel alone.

40:55.070 --> 40:56.660
Cao Changqing has great martial arts.

40:56.684 --> 40:58.284
But he doesn't take good care of people.

40:58.695 --> 40:59.925
If you travel on their boat,

41:00.270 --> 41:01.365
you can be more relieved.

41:04.520 --> 41:06.270
Invincible Cao Changqing.

41:06.720 --> 41:08.244
You're warning me, Your Highness?

41:09.595 --> 41:10.595
Clever girl.

41:10.620 --> 41:11.980
We don't need to be very specific.

41:12.270 --> 41:14.070
You awed our clan with an umbrella,

41:14.420 --> 41:15.764
just for this girl around you?

41:18.370 --> 41:19.450
It's so considerate of you.

41:20.795 --> 41:21.820
I have no other choice.

41:22.420 --> 41:24.580
My girl still owes me some money.

41:24.604 --> 41:25.604
She must be safe.

41:27.720 --> 41:29.204
Who owes you?

41:29.495 --> 41:31.495
Didn't I spend money
raising you for so many years?

41:35.570 --> 41:37.470
Make a list, then.

41:37.845 --> 41:39.221
I'll pay you back when I have money.

41:39.245 --> 41:40.525
The interest should be included.

41:42.420 --> 41:43.660
No matter how much you want me to pay,

41:43.684 --> 41:44.684
I'll pay it off.

41:48.420 --> 41:50.845
Young Master of North Liang.
Princess of West Chu.

41:51.445 --> 41:52.724
Who could expect that?

41:53.995 --> 41:55.045
What?

41:55.845 --> 41:56.845
Nothing.

41:58.170 --> 41:59.501
Your Highness, when you need the boat,

41:59.525 --> 42:00.525
just let me know.

42:01.120 --> 42:02.296
After I leave Mount Longhu,

42:02.320 --> 42:03.320
she should leave, too.

42:04.120 --> 42:05.795
You're going to Mount Longhu?

42:06.220 --> 42:08.485
What do you want? To get killed?

42:09.645 --> 42:10.541
When someone wants to kill me,

42:10.565 --> 42:11.945
he'll do it wherever I go.

42:13.120 --> 42:14.204
It's a deal, then.

42:15.045 --> 42:16.301
What else do you want, Your Highness?

42:16.325 --> 42:17.695
I indeed want another favor

42:17.870 --> 42:19.164
from your family.

42:19.470 --> 42:20.470
I need your boats, too.

42:20.895 --> 42:21.781
For escorting someone?

42:21.805 --> 42:22.445
No.

42:22.745 --> 42:23.885
For picking up someone.

42:24.345 --> 42:25.084
Who?

42:25.320 --> 42:26.901
Some people from different places.

42:26.925 --> 42:27.925
It'll be troublesome.

42:28.995 --> 42:30.805
We do business in all waterways.

42:31.095 --> 42:32.346
No matter whom you want to pick up,

42:32.370 --> 42:33.525
just tell me.

42:33.645 --> 42:34.540
I can't tell you

42:34.564 --> 42:35.804
until the time has come to act.

42:36.070 --> 42:37.146
In case I give away your secret?

42:37.170 --> 42:38.260
I've prepared my plan

42:38.284 --> 42:39.445
for such a long time

42:39.745 --> 42:41.065
and too many people are involved.

42:42.670 --> 42:44.124
I have to keep it to myself only.

42:45.045 --> 42:46.420
I won't tell anyone

42:46.795 --> 42:48.164
until the last minute.

43:29.825 --> 43:32.545
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.320 --> 43:37.120
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.045 --> 43:41.965
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.045 --> 43:46.845
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.145 --> 43:51.045
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.745 --> 43:55.565
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.570 --> 44:00.325
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.345 --> 44:05.270
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.770 --> 44:08.501
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.525 --> 44:09.765
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.545 --> 44:14.405
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.220 --> 44:17.946
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.970 --> 44:19.405
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.895 --> 44:23.770
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.195 --> 44:25.546
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.570 --> 44:28.405
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.820 --> 44:31.301
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.325 --> 44:33.725
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.020 --> 44:36.046
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.070 --> 44:38.246
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.270 --> 44:42.485
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.845 --> 44:43.981
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.005 --> 44:47.045
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.220 --> 44:49.181
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.205 --> 44:51.925
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.485 --> 44:54.301
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.325 --> 44:56.821
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.845 --> 45:00.945
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
